{
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "cache-store",
    "project": "dcu-monitoring"
  },
  "spec": {
    "display": {
      "name": "HiCache 与 Mooncake",
      "description": "数据源：test4 VictoriaMetrics。缺失或无效观测留空；默认 1 小时 / 15 秒刷新。"
    },
    "duration": "1h",
    "refreshInterval": "15s",
    "variables": [
      {
        "kind": "ListVariable",
        "spec": {
          "name": "role",
          "display": {
            "name": "角色"
          },
          "defaultValue": ".*",
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "StaticListVariable",
            "spec": {
              "values": [
                {
                  "value": ".*",
                  "label": "全部"
                },
                {
                  "value": "prefill",
                  "label": "Prefill / dcu1"
                },
                {
                  "value": "decode",
                  "label": "Decode / dcu2"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "panels": {
      "p0": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "模型缓存命中率",
            "description": "指标含义\n最近约 60 秒内模型前缀缓存命中 Token 占查询输入 Token 的比例。按模型节点/角色区分；属于 Token 加权比例，不是命中请求数占比。\n\nY 轴单位\n百分比；图中 50 表示 50%，不是 0.5。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "%",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.cache_60s.ratio\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.cache_60s.ratio\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.cache_60s.ratio\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.cache_60s.ratio\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.cache_60s.ratio\"}) < 15)) * 100",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p1": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "缓存命中分层",
            "description": "指标含义\n最近约 60 秒内设备、主机内存、存储层的缓存命中 Token 分层比例。分母沿用源监控输入 Token 口径；分层语义以源指标为准，不能直接据此推断物理 SSD 读写或全局缓存收益。\n\nY 轴单位\n百分比；图中 50 表示 50%，不是 0.5。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "%",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.cache_60s.(device|host|storage)\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.cache_60s.(device|host|storage)\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.cache_60s.(device|host|storage)\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.cache_60s.(device|host|storage)\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.cache_60s.(device|host|storage)\"}) < 15)) * 100",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p2": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "HiCache 容量使用率",
            "description": "指标含义\n代表 rank 的 HiCache 已用 Token 容量 ÷ 总 Token 容量 × 100%。这是容量占用率，不是命中率；代表 rank 用于避免直接累加复制容量。\n\nY 轴单位\n百分比；图中 50 表示 50%，不是 0.5。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "%",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.hicache.representative.ratio\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.hicache.representative.ratio\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.hicache.representative.ratio\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.hicache.representative.ratio\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.hicache.representative.ratio\"}) < 15)) * 100",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p3": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "HiCache Token 容量",
            "description": "指标含义\n代表 rank 的 HiCache 已用及总 Token 容量。单位为可容纳的 Token 数量，不是字节或 Token/秒；不要把复制 rank 的容量相加作为实际可用容量。\n\nY 轴单位\nToken 数。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "Token",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.hicache.representative.(used|total)\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.hicache.representative.(used|total)\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.hicache.representative.(used|total)\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.hicache.representative.(used|total)\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"nodes.$role.hicache.representative.(used|total)\"}) < 15)) * 1",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p4": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Mooncake 内存配额",
            "description": "指标含义\nMooncake Store 内存后端已使用量及配置总配额，字节除以 2^30。表示 Store 管理的内存容量，不等于整机物理内存已用量。\n\nY 轴单位\nGiB；1 GiB = 2^30 字节。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "GiB",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.capacity.(used|total)\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.capacity.(used|total)\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.capacity.(used|total)\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.capacity.(used|total)\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.capacity.(used|total)\"}) < 15)) * 9.313225746154785e-10",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p5": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Mooncake SSD 配额",
            "description": "指标含义\nMooncake Store SSD 后端已使用量及配置总配额，字节除以 2^30。表示后端容量配额；单靠该曲线无法证明已经发生物理 SSD I/O 或配置已经通过读写验收。\n\nY 轴单位\nGiB；1 GiB = 2^30 字节。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "GiB",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.ssd_capacity.(used|total)\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.ssd_capacity.(used|total)\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.ssd_capacity.(used|total)\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.ssd_capacity.(used|total)\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.ssd_capacity.(used|total)\"}) < 15)) * 9.313225746154785e-10",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p6": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Store 查询成功比例",
            "description": "指标含义\n最近约 60 秒 Store 查询成功计数增量 ÷ 查询计数增量 × 100%。统计的是 Store 查询结果，不等于模型 Token 命中率，也不证明后续数据读取成功。\n\nY 轴单位\n百分比；图中 50 表示 50%，不是 0.5。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "%",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.query_60s.ratio\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.query_60s.ratio\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.query_60s.ratio\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.query_60s.ratio\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.query_60s.ratio\"}) < 15)) * 100",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "p7": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "display": {
            "name": "Store 分层查询命中率",
            "description": "指标含义\n最近约 60 秒 Store memory/ssd 分层查询命中比例，分母使用对应查询计数。它描述 Store 查询层的结果，不代表模型 Token 命中，也不等于物理 SSD I/O 比例。\n\nY 轴单位\n百分比；图中 50 表示 50%，不是 0.5。\n\n曲线与范围\nDCU 环境。图例区分节点、角色、实例、设备或统计分位数；筛选器仅改变所选序列，不自动生成集群去重汇总。"
          },
          "plugin": {
            "kind": "TimeSeriesChart",
            "spec": {
              "legend": {
                "position": "bottom",
                "mode": "list"
              },
              "yAxis": {
                "label": "%",
                "min": 0
              },
              "visual": {
                "display": "line",
                "lineWidth": 1,
                "connectNulls": false
              },
              "tooltip": {
                "enablePinning": true
              }
            }
          },
          "queries": [
            {
              "kind": "TimeSeriesQuery",
              "spec": {
                "plugin": {
                  "kind": "PrometheusTimeSeriesQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "query": "(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.tier_query_60s.(memory|ssd)\"} and (monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.tier_query_60s.(memory|ssd)\"} == 1) and (min_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.tier_query_60s.(memory|ssd)\"}[$__interval]) == 1) and (count_over_time(monitoring_chart_valid{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.tier_query_60s.(memory|ssd)\"}[$__interval]) >= ($__interval / 5)) and (time() - timestamp(monitoring_chart_value{environment=\"dcu-pd\",schema=\"v1\",path=~\"mooncake.tier_query_60s.(memory|ssd)\"}) < 15)) * 100",
                    "seriesNameFormat": "{{path}}",
                    "minStep": "5s"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "layouts": [
      {
        "kind": "Grid",
        "spec": {
          "items": [
            {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/p0"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 12,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/p1"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 8,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/p2"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 12,
              "y": 8,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/p3"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 16,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/p4"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 12,
              "y": 16,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/p5"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 24,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/p6"
              }
            },
            {
              "x": 12,
              "y": 24,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 8,
              "content": {
                "$ref": "#/spec/panels/p7"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
